Follow AGENTS.md.

Never invent institutional facts.
Never hard-code secrets.
Never weaken security to fix an error.
Never trust client-side authorization or payment state.
Treat Foundation students as potentially minors.
Minimize personal data collection.
Do not publish unapproved legal text.
Do not add unsupported marketing claims.
